@startuml
title <size:24>Dynamic View: Pizzaco Order Service - Order API</size>\n<size:24>How POST /orders runs. Note that the aggregate is constructed three times before it is saved once, and that three of these steps reach systems that are only simulated.</size>

set separator none
!pragma teoz true
hide stereotype

